{"meta":{"ui":"checkout","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Build a small checkout in three steps: my cart (three items with quantities), a shipping form (name, address, city, postcode, email, all checked, with messages under the fields), then a payment summary with a choice of standard or express delivery changing the total, and a confirmation screen with an order number. I can go back a step without losing what I typed.","text":"state step=1\nstate cart=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Espresso beans, 1 kg\",\"price\":24,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Ceramic pour-over set\",\"price\":38,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Paper filters (100)\",\"price\":6,\"qty\":2}]\nstate name=\"\"\nstate address=\"\"\nstate city=\"\"\nstate postcode=\"\"\nstate email=\"\"\nstate delivery=\"standard\"\nstate subtotal=sum(cart,i=>i.price*i.qty)\nstate shipping=delivery==\"express\"?12:4\nstate total=subtotal+shipping\nstate orderNo=\"KX-\"+string(round(random()*90000+10000,0))\nColumn gap:12 pad:16\n  Row between middle\n    Text.pageTitle \"Checkout\"\n    Badge.neutral \"Step {step} of 3\"\n  if step==1\n    Card gap:10\n      Text.sectionTitle \"My cart\"\n      each row in cart\n        Row between middle\n          Text.body \"{row.name} x {row.qty}\"\n          Text.strong \"{money(row.price*row.qty,\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n      Divider\n      Row between\n        Text.strong \"Subtotal\"\n        Text.strong \"{money(subtotal,\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n      Button \"Continue to shipping\" -> step=2\n  if step==2\n    Card gap:10\n      Text.sectionTitle \"Shipping\"\n      Input \"Full name\" =name\n      if length(trim(name))==0\n        Text.danger \"Name is required.\"\n      Input \"Address\" =address\n      if length(trim(address))==0\n        Text.danger \"Address is required.\"\n      Input \"City\" =city\n      if length(trim(city))==0\n        Text.danger \"City is required.\"\n      Input \"Postcode\" =postcode\n      if length(tri